msgid ""
"icon:lock[title=Fixed at build time] [[quarkus-container-image-jib_quarkus-jib-jvm-entrypoint]] [.property-path]##link:#quarkus-container-image-jib_quarkus-jib-jvm-entrypoint[`quarkus.jib.jvm-entrypoint`]##\n"
