msgid ""
"[[quarkus-vertx-http_quarkus-http-proxy-allow-forwarded]] [.property-path]##link:#quarkus-vertx-http_quarkus-http-proxy-allow-forwarded[`quarkus.http.proxy.allow-forwarded`]##\n"
"config_property_copy_button:+++quarkus.http.proxy.allow-forwarded+++[]\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"[.description]\n"
"--\n"
"If this is true and proxy address forwarding is enabled then the standard `Forwarded` header will be used. In case the not standard `X-Forwarded-For` header is enabled and detected on HTTP requests, the standard header has the precedence. Activating this together with `quarkus.http.proxy.allow-x-forwarded` has security implications as clients can forge requests with a forwarded header that is not overwritten by the proxy. Therefore, proxies should strip unexpected `Forwarded` or `X-Forwarded-++*++` headers from the client.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Environment variable: env_var_with_copy_button:+++QUARKUS_HTTP_PROXY_ALLOW_FORWARDED+++[]\n"
"--"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"[[quarkus-vertx-http_quarkus-http-proxy-allow-forwarded]] [.property-path]##link:#quarkus-vertx-http_quarkus-http-proxy-allow-forwarded[`quarkus.http.proxy.allow-forwarded`]##\n"
"config_property_copy_button:+++quarkus.http.proxy.allow-forwarded+++[]"
msgstr ""

#, fuzzy
msgid "If this is true and proxy address forwarding is enabled then the standard `Forwarded` header will be used. In case the not standard `X-Forwarded-For` header is enabled and detected on HTTP requests, the standard header has the precedence. Activating this together with `quarkus.http.proxy.allow-x-forwarded` has security implications as clients can forge requests with a forwarded header that is not overwritten by the proxy. Therefore, proxies should strip unexpected `Forwarded` or `X-Forwarded-++*++` headers from the client."
msgstr "如果情况属实且已启用代理地址转发，则将使用标准的 `Forwarded` 头。如果启用了非标准的 `X-Forwarded-For` 头，且在 HTTP 请求中检测到该头，则标准头具有优先级。 若同时启用此选项与 `quarkus.http.proxy.allow-x-forwarded，` 将产生安全隐患，因为客户端可以伪造请求，其中包含不会被代理覆盖的 Forwarded 标头。因此，代理应从客户端请求中移除意外出现的 `Forwarded` 或 `X-Forwarded-*` 标头。"

msgid "Environment variable: env_var_with_copy_button:+++QUARKUS_HTTP_PROXY_ALLOW_FORWARDED+++[]"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
