#, fuzzy
msgid "When set to `single-node`, Redis transactions are supported in the cluster, but only when they target a single node. The `MULTI` command is queued and is only issued when the next command is executed. This next command binds the connection to the corresponding node of the Redis cluster (so it should have keys, otherwise the target node is random). All subsequent commands are targeted to that node. If some of the subsequent commands have a key that belongs to another node, the command will fail on the server side. If `WATCH` is used before `MULTI`, its key(s) determine to which node the connection is bound and the subsequent `MULTI` is not queued. If `WATCH` keys belong to multiple nodes, the command fails on the client side."
msgstr "当设置为 `单节点模式` 时，集群中支持 Redis 事务，但仅限于针对单个节点的事务。 `MULTI` 命令会被放入队列，并仅在执行下一个命令时才被发出。 接下来的这条命令会将连接绑定到 Redis 集群中的相应节点（因此该连接应包含键，否则目标节点将随机选择）。此后所有命令均针对该节点。如果后续命令中某些命令的键属于其他节点，则该命令将在服务器端失败。 如果在 `MULTI` 之前使用了 `WATCH` ，其键将决定连接绑定到哪个节点，且随后的 `MULTI` 不会被排入队列。如果 `WATCH` 键属于多个节点，该命令将在客户端失败。"

